## 4. Architecture & data flow (selected)

- Route handlers stay thin: validate (arktype) → call repo/ai layer → return JSON. Confirmed in `sources.ts`, `llmkey.ts`.
- All SQL through `repo.ts` + `conversations.ts`. Async (libSQL).
- AI prompts in `src/lib/server/ai/prompts.ts` (not read here) as pure functions.
- Zustand single store on client.
- Error envelope `{ error: string }` with status codes. Confirmed.
- User/AI content as JSX text only. Confirmed (except documented innerHTML).

